    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Lettings Solutions are proud to present a rare opportunity to acquire this beautifully presented semi-detached 4 - Bed 3- Bath  2 reception rooms family residence, ideally positioned in a mature and highly sought-after neighbourhood in Seabury Malahide.\r\nConveniently located close to local shopping facilities, the scenic Broadmeadow Estuary, and the vibrant village of Malahide, residents can enjoy an excellent selection of restaurants, boutiques, schools, and the DART station, all within easy reach.  Access to the M50 and the M1 are minutes away.\r\n\r\nThis stunning family accommodation has just been upgraded to a very high standard.  \r\nadding all new furnishings, fittings and new  light ash flooring throughout the whole house.\r\n\r\n\r\nAmong its many attractive features is a bright open-plan extended oak kitchen with centre island and black grainte worktops ,dining and family area overlooking the sunny west facing garden, a formal lounge to the front boasts a feature fireplace  with real coal fire while the converted garage offers a versatile playroom, home office, study, or bedroom . A second reception room which leads from the main sitting room can also be accessed from the kitchen/dining area ..A guest WC completes the accommodation on the ground floor and glazed doors lead from the kitchen are to a paved garden and patio area.\r\nThe white goods in the kitchen have all been replaced with brand new ones.\r\nUpstairs, there are three generously proportioned bedrooms master with on suite . fully fitted wardrobes in all bedrooms and main bathroom finished to a high standard.\r\n\r\nThe gardens are a particular highlight of the property. To the front, drive in parking for three  cars. The wonderful west-facing rear garden enjoys sunshine throughout the afternoon and evening and features a large patio area ideal for outdoor dining for the whole family to enjoy.\r\n\r\nMalahide village. Malahide Park, and the stunning Malahide Marina are all within walking distance. They are plenty of local schools in the area both primary and secondary level.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended by Patricia in Letting Solutions.\r\nPlease email only with your expression of interest,\r\nPSRA Licence 003292"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Second Reception Room Leads by glazed doors to a very sunny rear garden with all day sunshine."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Drive in parking \r\nPaved Patio/Garden\r\nLarge spacious open plan ktichen\r\nNew flooring,\r\nBrand new white goods\r\nSeaprate Utility Room \r\nAlle new rooler blinds \r\n2 Receptions Rooms."
      },
